      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5201,
      "text": "It is He Who created you, yet some of you are disbelievers and some of you are believers. And Allah is All-Seeing of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5202,
      "text": "He created the heavens and earth for a true purpose, He shaped you and perfected your form. And to Him is the final return.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5203,
      "text": "He knows all that is in the heavens and earth, and He knows whatever you conceal and whatever you reveal. And Allah is All-Knowing of what is in the hearts.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5204,
      "text": "Has there not come to you the stories of those who disbelieved before you? They tasted the evil consequence of their deeds, and for them there will be a painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5205,
      "text": "That is because their messengers came to them with clear proofs, but they said, “How can a human guide us?” Thus they disbelieved and turned away, but Allah had no need for them, for Allah is Self-Sufficient, Praiseworthy.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5206,
      "text": "The disbelievers claim that they will never be resurrected. Say, “Yes, by my Lord, you will surely be resurrected, then you will surely be informed of what you did. And that is easy for Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5207,
      "text": "So believe in Allah and His Messenger, and in the Light [i.e., the Qur’an] that We have sent down. And Allah is All-Aware of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 556,
      "ruku": 490,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5208,
      "text": "When He will gather you for the Gathering Day; that is the Day of great loss[1]. But whoever believes in Allah and does righteous deeds, He will absolve them of their bad deeds and will admit them to gardens under which rivers flow, abiding therein forever. That is the supreme triumph.",
